# Contested Game Ball: "Whenever you're dealt combat damage, the attacking player gains control of this artifact and untaps it."
# Bot1 draws with it on turns 1 and 3 (two point counters), leaving it tapped. Bot2 attacks with two Memnites on
# turn 4: both deal combat damage at once, which is one trigger (a stack of one), and it resolves by handing the tapped Ball
# over, untapped and with its two counters, to Bot2, who draws with it for a third counter. Bot1 is at 18.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Contested Game Ball
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Memnite
Memnite
Island x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Contested Game Ball.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Contested Game Ball.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Contested Game Ball.Counters.Point = 1
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Contested Game Ball.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Contested Game Ball.Counters.Point = 2
[T4 Bot2.DeclareAttackers]
Bot2.Attack(Memnite#1 > Bot1; Memnite#2 > Bot1)
[T4 Bot2.CombatDamage]
? Stack.Count = 1
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Contested Game Ball = (absent)
? Bot2.Battlefield.Contested Game Ball.Tapped = false
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Contested Game Ball.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Contested Game Ball.Counters.Point = 3
Bot2.Battlefield.Contested Game Ball.Tapped = true
Bot1.Life = 18
